  "full_text": "Few people know what that means, huh? The Holy Spirit never abandoned us. Drink this up. Bite tight. It works. It works excellent. At least for now. Probably have to do it again. What? Hey, you've been banging angels. Quit it, eh? You bastard. I gotta get another beer. What? What you banging angels for? Guys laughing. Crazy. These guys laughing. So I should try to light the next cigarette off the last. Chainsmoke? No. Just a little. The Holy Spirit got pissed off at me once. But it's okay. Like, a couple reasons. Just like, he said, like, no sex for three days. And then, like, anyway. What was the other thing? I don't remember. Not just now. He didn't say that again. Eh? That was, like, earlier. What?",
